{"title": "Fancy Trader Table", "pageid": 13910, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fancy_Trader_Table", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Vendor tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Fancy Trader Table</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Vendor_Fancy</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Vendor_Fancy+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Vendor_Fancy+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing a wide variety of <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h2>\n<p><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Fancy Trader Table}}</code>.</i>\n<i>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Fancy Trader Table</a> is worth a total of 55.5 + # <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a> on average.</i>\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Food\">Food</span></h4>\n<p><i>Rolls two or three times. Worth 14.8 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a> on average.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n  <tbody><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Quantity</th><td>2</td><td>3</td></tr>\n  <tr style=\"text-align:center\"><th>Chance</th>  <td>3/5</td><td>2/5</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" 